title: 'YAP runtime: enable local dev mode and tune elastic scaling parameters'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Updates the Yet Another Parachain (YAP) testing runtime to make local
      development easier and to exercise higher elastic scaling throughput:

      - Adds a `dev` cargo feature that sets `RELAY_PARENT_OFFSET = 0` so the
        runtime can be run locally with `polkadot-omni-node --dev` without a
        live relay chain.
      - Bumps `BLOCK_PROCESSING_VELOCITY` from 3 to 12 and derives
        `UNINCLUDED_SEGMENT_CAPACITY` from `(3 + RELAY_PARENT_OFFSET) * BLOCK_PROCESSING_VELOCITY`.
      - Adds a README with build and run instructions for the dev setup.
      - Bumps `spec_version` to `1_003_002`.

crates:
  - name: yet-another-parachain-runtime
    bump: patch
